    "sub_ename": "A HISTORY OF WESTERN  ARCHITECTURE",
    "describe_ch": "充實同學對建築發展有關人文方面的基本認識,藉著對西方建築發展脈絡的瞭解,作為認識西方近代建築的基礎,並從而建立建築的歷史觀和世界觀.",
    "describe_eh": "In light of introduction of the history and development of western architecture, the goal of this course is meant for students to acquire deeper understanding of western modern architecture, and hence to have historic and global view of world architecture.",
